6:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","The Barbican Conservatory",{"children":"The Barbican Conservatory"}]]}]
7:["$","section","Silk St, London EC2Y 8DS",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Silk St, London EC2Y 8DS"}],[["$","p","The Barbican’s awe-inspiring conservatory is the ideal location for taking stunning shots. Even better, entry is free.",{"children":"The Barbican’s awe-inspiring conservatory is the ideal location for taking stunning shots. Even better, entry is free."}],["$","p","However, you will need to get there quickly if you wish to take photographs in peace.",{"children":"However, you will need to get there quickly if you wish to take photographs in peace."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Peggy Porschen",{"children":"Peggy Porschen"}]]}]]}]
8:["$","section","116 Ebury St, Belgravia, London SW1W 9QQ",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"116 Ebury St, Belgravia, London SW1W 9QQ"}],[["$","p","When it comes to the term “beautiful in pink,” Peggy Porschen gives a whole new meaning. This Belgravia bakery is a favourite among royals and celebrities, and it features a pastel pink front that is bordered by rose bushes. Very endearing, to put it mildly!",{"children":"When it comes to the term “beautiful in pink,” Peggy Porschen gives a whole new meaning. This Belgravia bakery is a favourite among royals and celebrities, and it features a pastel pink front that is bordered by rose bushes. Very endearing, to put it mildly!"}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","God’s own Junkyard",{"children":"God’s own Junkyard"}]]}]]}]
9:["$","section","Unit 12, Ravenswood Industrial Estate, Shernhall St, Walthamstow, London E17 9HQ",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Unit 12, Ravenswood Industrial Estate, Shernhall St, Walthamstow, London E17 9HQ"}],[["$","p","This treasure trove of neon signage is comparable to stepping into a fast-paced 1970s throwback flick.",{"children":"This treasure trove of neon signage is comparable to stepping into a fast-paced 1970s throwback flick."}],["$","p","This is London at its most Instagrammable, with its vibrant hues, flashing lights, and tongue-in-cheek slogans.",{"children":"This is London at its most Instagrammable, with its vibrant hues, flashing lights, and tongue-in-cheek slogans."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Big Ben and the Palace of Westminster from the South Bank",{"children":"Big Ben and the Palace of Westminster from the South Bank"}]]}]]}]
a:["$","section","Belvedere Rd, Bishop’s, London SE1 7GA",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Belvedere Rd, Bishop’s, London SE1 7GA"}],[["$","p","On the opposite side of Westminster Bridge between Big Ben and the Palace of Westminster is a little passage leading beneath the bridge.",{"children":"On the opposite side of Westminster Bridge between Big Ben and the Palace of Westminster is a little passage leading beneath the bridge."}],["$","p","The entrance to the corridor frames Big Ben and the Palace for a great photograph of two of London’s most renowned structures.",{"children":"The entrance to the corridor frames Big Ben and the Palace for a great photograph of two of London’s most renowned structures."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","The Colourful Houses of Notting Hill",{"children":"The Colourful Houses of Notting Hill"}]]}]]}]
b:["$","section","34C Lancaster Rd, Notting Hill, London W11 1QR",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"34C Lancaster Rd, Notting Hill, London W11 1QR"}],[["$","p","People visit Notting Hill for the rainbow-hued houses on Lancaster Road and Portobello Road.",{"children":"People visit Notting Hill for the rainbow-hued houses on Lancaster Road and Portobello Road."}],["$","p","The neighbourhood is Instagrammable to the core, with its abundance of quaint cafes and lovely boutiques, but the rainbow-hued houses on Lancaster Road and Portobello Road are the main attraction.",{"children":"The neighbourhood is Instagrammable to the core, with its abundance of quaint cafes and lovely boutiques, but the rainbow-hued houses on Lancaster Road and Portobello Road are the main attraction."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Neal’s Yard",{"children":"Neal’s Yard"}]]}]]}]
c:["$","section","Neal’s Yard, London WC2H 9DP",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Neal’s Yard, London WC2H 9DP"}],[["$","p","Neal’s Yard is not only one of the favourite spots in London, but also one of the city’s most photogenic.",{"children":"Neal’s Yard is not only one of the favourite spots in London, but also one of the city’s most photogenic."}],["$","p","Hidden in two alleys near Covent Garden, this area was saved from demolition in the 1990s and now features a plethora of colourful buildings and plants.",{"children":"Hidden in two alleys near Covent Garden, this area was saved from demolition in the 1990s and now features a plethora of colourful buildings and plants."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","London Eye",{"children":"London Eye"}]]}]]}]
d:["$","section","The Queen’s Walk, Bishop’s, London SE1 7PB",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The Queen’s Walk, Bishop’s, London SE1 7PB"}],[["$","p","Since it opened at the turn of the millennium, the Coca-Cola London Eye has topped everyone’s list of things to do in the city.",{"children":"Since it opened at the turn of the millennium, the Coca-Cola London Eye has topped everyone’s list of things to do in the city."}],["$","p","It’s also a great spot to snap some shots of the nearby Palace of Westminster and the River Thames.",{"children":"It’s also a great spot to snap some shots of the nearby Palace of Westminster and the River Thames."}],["$","p","Before you descend from the peak of your adventure, hop in your capsule and snap that picture of the capsule in front of you, the River Thames, and the Palace of Westminster.",{"children":"Before you descend from the peak of your adventure, hop in your capsule and snap that picture of the capsule in front of you, the River Thames, and the Palace of Westminster."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Tower Bridge",{"children":"Tower Bridge"}]]}]]}]
e:["$","section","Tower Bridge Rd, London SE1 2UP",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tower Bridge Rd, London SE1 2UP"}],[["$","p","Whether you’re a professional or an amateur photographer, you’ll be blown away by the Tower Bridge photo opportunities.",{"children":"Whether you’re a professional or an amateur photographer, you’ll be blown away by the Tower Bridge photo opportunities."}],["$","p","You can get some fantastic shots from a traffic island in the middle of the road. Another classic London backdrop is the area around the Dolphin statue on St. Katharine’s Walk.",{"children":"You can get some fantastic shots from a traffic island in the middle of the road. Another classic London backdrop is the area around the Dolphin statue on St. Katharine’s Walk."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Richmond Park",{"children":"Richmond Park"}]]}]]}]
f:["$","section","Richmond, Kingston upon Thames TW10 5HS",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Richmond, Kingston upon Thames TW10 5HS"}],[["$","p","Due to its history as a royal hunting ground, Richmond Park still features free-roaming deer.",{"children":"Due to its history as a royal hunting ground, Richmond Park still features free-roaming deer."}],["$","p","It’s not only unusual for London, but also one of the quietest places to take pictures.",{"children":"It’s not only unusual for London, but also one of the quietest places to take pictures."}],["$","p","Caution: when trying to take a shot at a deer, don’t get too close to the animal.",{"children":"Caution: when trying to take a shot at a deer, don’t get too close to the animal."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Little Venice",{"children":"Little Venice"}]]}]]}]
10:["$","section","Maida Ave, Little Venice, London W2 1ST",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Maida Ave, Little Venice, London W2 1ST"}],[["$","p","Despite its North London location, Little Venice’s canals bring to mind those of Amsterdam and the Venetian lagoon (we guess the clue was really in the name)",{"children":"Despite its North London location, Little Venice’s canals bring to mind those of Amsterdam and the Venetian lagoon (we guess the clue was really in the name)"}],["$","p","Taking a boat ride along the river is a great opportunity to capture one of London’s most unique neighbourhoods – not to mention providing a beautiful backdrop for your secret London Instagram photos.",{"children":"Taking a boat ride along the river is a great opportunity to capture one of London’s most unique neighbourhoods – not to mention providing a beautiful backdrop for your secret London Instagram photos."}],["$","p","Address:",{"children":"Address:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Natural History Museum",{"children":"Natural History Museum"}]]}]]}]
11:["$","section","Cromwell Rd, South Kensington, London SW7 5BD",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Cromwell Rd, South Kensington, London SW7 5BD"}],[["$","p","We’ve come to value the Natural History Museum’s imposing architecture as one of London’s most spectacular shooting settings nearly as highly as its fascinating collections. Almost.",{"children":"We’ve come to value the Natural History Museum’s imposing architecture as one of London’s most spectacular shooting settings nearly as highly as its fascinating collections. Almost."}],["$","p","Tip: Arrive early to snap photos of the enormous blue whale skeleton on display in Hintz Hall.",{"children":"Tip: Arrive early to snap photos of the enormous blue whale skeleton on display in Hintz Hall."}],["$","p","DO YOU KNOW?",{"children":"DO YOU KNOW?"}],["$","p","London is a city rich in diversity and a desirable place to live. With one of the highest numbers of international students, London is also a major hub in the world of higher education.",{"children":"London is a city rich in diversity and a desirable place to live. With one of the highest numbers of international students, London is also a major hub in the world of higher education."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
12:["$","section","That being the case, why not take advantage of the chance to attend college in London?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"That being the case, why not take advantage of the chance to attend college in London?"}],[["$","p","Contact us to schedule a free counselling appointment.",{"children":"Contact us to schedule a free counselling appointment."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
